): 'the 20 cases are derived: session-log mining over that window'","AC3: 'a 20-row per-case table'"],"finding":"The Context states the CI-at-landing friction category is '25/60', but Read (b) and AC3 fix the case count at '20' cases derived from the newer-30 window. The 25-vs-20 discrepancy is unexplained: it is unclear whether 20 is a subset of the 25, a coincidental derivation target, or a hard requirement that the mining must hit exactly.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"ff899c2788a2550bd","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Context vs Approach Read (b) vs AC3","norm_id":"nd8d84c7b553e8e7c","priority":0.7778,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Session-log mining over the window yields 18 or 23 CI-failure cases, and AC3's hard '20-row' requirement cannot be met, blocking completion","A reader cannot reconcile the 25 category count with the 20-row deliverable"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Change AC3 to 'a per-case table of every Verified -1 / CI-failure case mined from 2026-08-25..2026-08-30, with the case count stated inline' and drop the fixed 20-row requirement, explaining how 20 relates to R2S3's 25.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.7778,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"underspecified_oracle","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"certification_cannot_prove","internal_conflict":"medium","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","li